{"seq":1,"slug":"weather-lighting","title":"天气光照影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/presentation/weather-lighting","wordCount":1286,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"天气光照影响\">天气光照影响</h1><p>为什么一进阴雨天玩家立刻就「感觉到」了，哪怕还没看见一滴雨？因为天色先变了——主光变弱、影子变软、整个世界蒙上一层冷灰。天气对沉浸感最大的贡献其实不是雨本身，而是它对照明的全局改写。这一篇讲天气如何调制场景的光照：主光的强度与色温、环境光的抬升、雷电的瞬时强光、以及天气与色调映射、体积雾光柱的耦合。它消费<a href=\"../phenomena/clouds-fog\">云与雾</a>的天光遮蔽与<a href=\"../foundations/weather-state-machine\">天气状态机</a>的云量，但具体的 PBR、阴影、后处理管线属于<a href=\"../../game-graphics/\">游戏图形</a>，本篇只讲「天气作为输入如何驱动它们」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-天气是照明的全局调制器\">核心概念：天气是照明的全局调制器</h2><p>把天气想成一个作用在整套照明参数上的调制层。晴天时主光（太阳/月亮）强、方向清晰、阴影硬朗、色温偏暖；阴雨天厚云把直射光大量遮挡，主光强度骤降、阴影变软甚至消失，与此同时天空的均匀散射让环境光不降反「提」，整体趋于无方向的平光与冷色。这一升一降是阴天观感的核心。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[状态机: cloudCover] --&gt; B[天光遮蔽量]&#10;  B --&gt; C[主光强度 下降]&#10;  B --&gt; D[阴影软化]&#10;  B --&gt; E[环境光/天空光 抬升]&#10;  A --&gt; F[色温 偏冷]&#10;  C --&gt; G[最终照明]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  H[雷电触发器] --&gt; I[瞬时全场强光]&#10;  I --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; J[色调映射/曝光]\">flowchart TD\n  A[状态机: cloudCover] --&gt; B[天光遮蔽量]\n  B --&gt; C[主光强度 下降]\n  B --&gt; D[阴影软化]\n  B --&gt; E[环境光/天空光 抬升]\n  A --&gt; F[色温 偏冷]\n  C --&gt; G[最终照明]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  H[雷电触发器] --&gt; I[瞬时全场强光]\n  I --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; J[色调映射/曝光]</pre><p>下表给出几种天气对关键照明参数的典型调制方向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>晴</th>\n<th>阴/雨</th>\n<th>雷暴瞬间</th>\n<th>雪</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主光强度</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极高（脉冲）</td>\n<td>中（被雪面反弹）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主光色温</td>\n<td>暖</td>\n<td>冷</td>\n<td>冷白</td>\n<td>冷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阴影硬度</td>\n<td>硬</td>\n<td>软/无</td>\n<td>硬（瞬时）</td>\n<td>软</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境光</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>抬升</td>\n<td>抬升</td>\n<td>高（雪面高反照率）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>雾密度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"主光与环境光的此消彼长\">主光与环境光的此消彼长</h2><p>实现上，最核心的两条曲线是「主光强度随云量下降」和「环境光强度随云量抬升」。设云量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，主光强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{sun} = I_0 (1 - k_s c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，天空环境光 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{sky} = I_b (1 + k_a c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。云量越大，直射越弱、散射越强，二者在阴天交汇成那种「没有影子的灰」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hlsl\" data-code=\"// 天气调制主/环境光（简化）&#10;float cloud = WeatherCloudCover();           // 来自状态机&#10;float sunIntensity = baseSun * (1 - 0.8 * cloud);&#10;float skyIntensity = baseSky * (1 + 0.5 * cloud);&#10;float3 sunColor = lerp(warmColor, coolColor, cloud); // 越阴越冷&#10;SetDirectionalLight(sunIntensity, sunColor);&#10;SetAmbient(skyIntensity);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 天气调制主/环境光（简化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float cloud = WeatherCloudCover();           // 来自状态机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float sunIntensity = baseSun * (1 - 0.8 * cloud);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float skyIntensity = baseSky * (1 + 0.5 * cloud);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float3 sunColor = lerp(warmColor, coolColor, cloud); // 越阴越冷</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SetDirectionalLight(sunIntensity, sunColor);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SetAmbient(skyIntensity);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这些都该走天气过渡而非瞬切——乌云压境时主光要在几秒内缓缓变暗，复用<a href=\"../foundations/weather-transitions\">天气过渡</a>的插值通道，让 <code>cloudCover</code> 的过渡自然带动照明的过渡。雪是个特例：雪面反照率极高，会把环境光大幅抬升并染白，雪原即使阴天也显得明亮刺眼，这一点单独调参。</p>\n<h2 id=\"雷电-瞬时照明事件\">雷电：瞬时照明事件</h2><p>雷电是天气照明里唯一的瞬时强事件，它由<a href=\"../foundations/weather-transitions\">天气过渡</a>的瞬时触发器按泊松过程定时。一次闪电不是简单地把屏幕刷白，而是一个有形状的强光脉冲：极短的上升、几帧的多次闪烁（真实闪电常有回击）、然后快速衰减。它把整个场景的主光在十几毫秒内推到极高，照亮平时阴影里的细节，再骤然回落。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[雷暴状态] --&gt; B[泊松定时触发]&#10;  B --&gt; C[闪电光脉冲&lt;br/&gt;升-多次闪烁-衰减]&#10;  C --&gt; D[全场主光瞬时拉高]&#10;  D --&gt; E[阴影瞬时变硬]&#10;  C --&gt; F[延迟雷声 dt=d/340]&#10;  F --&gt; G[天气音效]\">flowchart TD\n  A[雷暴状态] --&gt; B[泊松定时触发]\n  B --&gt; C[闪电光脉冲&lt;br/&gt;升-多次闪烁-衰减]\n  C --&gt; D[全场主光瞬时拉高]\n  D --&gt; E[阴影瞬时变硬]\n  C --&gt; F[延迟雷声 dt=d/340]\n  F --&gt; G[天气音效]</pre><p>闪电的关键是它与声音的配合：光先到、声后到，延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>340</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t = d/340</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/340</span></span></span></span></span> 秒由<a href=\"weather-audio\">天气音效</a>消费，让玩家凭光声差判断雷击远近。视觉上还常配一道屏幕外的方向性补光（暗示闪电在画面左侧），比单纯全屏刷白更可信。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与色调映射-曝光-雾的耦合\">与色调映射、曝光、雾的耦合</h2><p>天气照明不能脱离后处理孤立调。三个耦合点最关键。其一是<strong>自动曝光</strong>：天气把场景整体压暗后，自动曝光会试图把画面提亮，可能抵消掉「阴天该暗」的意图，所以天气系统常要给曝光补偿一个偏置，强行让阴雨天看起来就是暗的。其二是<strong>色调映射</strong>：阴雨的低对比、低饱和观感很大程度由色调映射曲线塑造，天气可以驱动一组后处理预设（饱和度、对比度、色彩平衡）随状态切换。其三是<strong>体积雾光柱</strong>：<a href=\"../phenomena/clouds-fog\">云与雾</a>的体积雾要接收主光才能形成丁达尔光柱，而主光强度正是被天气调制的——于是「阴天的光柱更弱、晴天树林里的光柱更强」自然成立。</p>\n<p>这些后处理的具体实现（曝光算法、色调映射曲线、屏幕空间效果）归<a href=\"../../game-graphics/\">游戏图形</a>，本篇只负责把天气状态翻译成驱动它们的参数集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>天气对沉浸感最大的贡献是对照明的全局改写，往往先于雨本身被玩家感知。</li>\n<li>阴雨的核心是「主光降、环境光升」此消彼长，加冷色温与软阴影，汇成无影的灰。</li>\n<li>照明调制要走天气过渡而非瞬切；雪因高反照率是「越阴越亮」的特例。</li>\n<li>雷电是唯一的瞬时强光事件，按泊松定时，配光声延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>340</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t=d/340</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/340</span></span></span></span></span> 判远近。</li>\n<li>必须与自动曝光（补偿以保住「该暗」）、色调映射、体积雾光柱耦合调，否则意图被抵消。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>天光遮蔽与云影的来源：<a href=\"../phenomena/clouds-fog\">云与雾</a></li>\n<li>照明调制复用的插值与雷电触发：<a href=\"../foundations/weather-transitions\">天气过渡</a></li>\n<li>闪电的配套雷声：<a href=\"weather-audio\">天气音效</a></li>\n<li>主光改变也影响湿面高光：<a href=\"wetness-surface\">湿润与表面响应</a></li>\n<li>PBR、阴影、后处理管线归属：<a href=\"../../game-graphics/\">游戏图形</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"天气光照影响","id":"天气光照影响"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：天气是照明的全局调制器","id":"核心概念-天气是照明的全局调制器"},{"level":2,"text":"主光与环境光的此消彼长","id":"主光与环境光的此消彼长"},{"level":2,"text":"雷电：瞬时照明事件","id":"雷电-瞬时照明事件"},{"level":2,"text":"与色调映射、曝光、雾的耦合","id":"与色调映射-曝光-雾的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"云与雾","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/phenomena/clouds-fog"},"next":{"title":"湿润与表面响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/presentation/wetness-surface"}}